data: {"answer": "This place is the **Privacy Chapel** (shown as 'Lakeside Chapel' in the tour). The stained glass displays principles of personal data protection. You can see controls for **Data Classification & Handling**, **Data Minimization**, and a **Retention Schedule**. Key concepts visible include the **Data Lifecycle**, **Privacy Principles**, and **Personal Data**.", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "What should I do next?", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "en", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 8.57, "total_s": 8.58}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "church_in", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "church_in"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 5.8}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "church_in", "label": "Room", "en": "Lakeside Chapel", "zh": "湖畔教堂"}, {"key": "data_classification", "label": "Control", "en": "Data Classification & Handling", "zh": "資料分級與處理規則"}, {"key": "retention_deletion", "label": "Control", "en": "Data Minimization & Retention Schedule", "zh": "資料最小化與保存期限"}, {"key": "c_data_lifecycle", "label": "Concept", "en": "Data Lifecycle", "zh": "資料生命週期"}, {"key": "c_privacy_principles", "label": "Concept", "en": "Privacy Principles", "zh": "個資保護原則"}, {"key": "c_personal_data", "label": "Concept", "en": "Personal Data", "zh": "個人資料"}], "edges": [{"a": "c_personal_data", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "church_in"}, {"a": "c_privacy_principles", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "church_in"}, {"a": "c_privacy_principles", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "retention_deletion"}, {"a": "c_data_lifecycle", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "church_in"}, {"a": "c_data_lifecycle", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "retention_deletion"}, {"a": "c_data_lifecycle", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "data_classification"}, {"a": "data_classification", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "church_in"}, {"a": "retention_deletion", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "church_in"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "Room: Privacy Chapel (called 'Lakeside Chapel' in the tour)\nWhat it shows: The stained glass shows the principles of personal data protection.\nKey lesson: Use personal data only for its purpose, keep it accurate and safe, and delete it on time.\nControls you can see: Data Classification & Handling, Data Minimization & Retention Schedule\nConcepts: Data Lifecycle, Privacy Principles, Personal Data\nProcedures to know: A guest asks to see, correct or delete their data\nExits: Harbour Square · Suppliers, Chapel Close-up · Privacy Principles (called 'Chapel · Up Close' in the tour)", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.57, "load_s": 0.01, "prompt_tokens": 574, "prompt_s": 2.45, "gen_tokens": 72, "gen_s": 6.1, "tok_per_s": 11.8, "first_token_s": 2.47}}, "state": {}}

